---
layout: base.njk
isHome: true
---
{%- set heroR = collections.tarifler | bySlug(home.hero.slug) -%}
{%- set vids = collections.tarifler | bySlugs(home.videos) -%}
<div class="wrap hero">
  <a class="feature" href="{{ heroR.url | link }}">
    <span class="photo">{% visual { image: heroR.data.image, heroImage: home.hero.heroImage, imageAlt: heroR.data.imageAlt, title: heroR.data.title, art: heroR.data.art }, 'scene', heroR.fileSlug %}</span>
    {% if not (home.hero.heroImage or heroR.data.image) %}<span class="ph-tag">Fotoğraf alanı</span>{% endif %}
    <span class="over">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ home.hero.eyebrow }}</span>
      <h1>{{ heroR.data.title }}</h1>
      <span class="meta"><span>{{ heroR.data.prep + heroR.data.cook }} dk</span><span>{{ heroR.data.serv }} kişilik</span><span>{{ heroR.data.lvl }}</span></span>
    </span>
  </a>
  <aside class="popular">
    <div class="eyebrow">Bu hafta en çok bakılanlar</div>
    <div class="pop-list">
      {% for r in collections.tarifler | bySlugs(home.popular) %}
      <a class="pop-item" href="{{ r.url | link }}"><span class="th" style="background:{{ r.fileSlug | tint }}">{% visual r.data, 'plate', r.fileSlug %}</span><span><b><span class="n">{{ loop.index }}</span>{{ r.data.title }}</b><span>{{ r.data.prep + r.data.cook }} dk · {{ r.data.serv }} kişilik</span></span></a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

<section class="block" id="kategoriler" style="padding-top:8px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><h2>Kategoriler</h2></div>
    <div class="cat-group">
      <h3>Sofraya göre<span>Ne pişirmek istiyorsun?</span></h3>
      <div class="cats">
        {% for c in categories.types %}
        <a class="cat" href="{{ ('/kategori/' + c.k + '/') | link }}"><span class="ic" style="background:{{ c.k | tint }}">{% plateArt c.art, c.k %}</span><b>{{ c.l }}</b></a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cat-group">
      <h3>Sana göre<span>Beslenme tercihi ve vakit</span></h3>
      <div class="diet">
        {% for c in categories.diets %}
        <a class="dcard{% if c.wc %} wc{% endif %}" href="{{ ('/kategori/' + c.k + '/') | link }}"><span class="ic" style="{% if not c.wc %}background:{{ c.k | tint }}{% endif %}">{% plateArt c.art, c.k %}</span><span><b>{{ c.l }}</b><span>{{ c.s }}</span><em>{{ (collections.tarifler | inCat(c.k)).length }} tarif</em></span></a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block" style="padding-top:12px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">Son eklenenler</div><h2>Yeni tarifler</h2></div>
      <a class="clear" href="{{ '/tarifler/' | link }}">Tüm tarifler</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">{% for r in collections.tarifler | take(8) %}{% include "card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if vids[0] %}{% set v = vids[0] %}{% include "video-band.njk" %}{% endif %}

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="picker-promo">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Karar veremeyenlere</div>
        <h2>Bugün ne pişirsem?</h2>
        <p>Ruh halini seç, sana uygun tarifi bulalım. Tür, zorluk ve süreyi de ayarlayabilirsin.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mood-links">
        {% for m in moods %}<a href="{{ ('/bugun-ne-pisirsem/#' + m.k) | link }}"><b>{{ m.l }}</b><span>{{ m.s }}</span></a>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block" id="hizli" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="wc-band">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Kategori · Beyaz yakalılar için hızlı tarifler</div>
          <h2>Mesaiden çık, kısa sürede sofrada ol.</h2>
          <p>Tek kap, az bulaşık, ertesi gün ofis kutusuna da giren tarifler.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="clear" href="{{ '/kategori/hizli/' | link }}">Kategorinin tümü</a>
      </div>
      <div class="wc-grid">
        {% for r in collections.tarifler | inCat('hizli') | sortByMin | take(4) %}
        <a class="wc-card" href="{{ r.url | link }}"><span class="clock">{{ r.data.prep + r.data.cook }}<small>dk</small></span><b>{{ r.data.title }}</b><span>{{ r.data.desc }}</span></a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="wc-split">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Hafta hazırlığı</div>
          <h3>Pazar 2 saat, hafta boyu 5 öğle yemeği.</h3>
          <p>Fırın ve ocak aynı anda çalışır: bir tepsi sebze-tavuk, bir tencere bulgur, bir tencere çorba. Pazartesiden cumaya kutular hazır.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="week">
          {% for w in home.week %}<div class="day"><span class="d">{{ w.d }}</span><div class="box" aria-hidden="true">{% for c in w.c %}<i style="background:var(--{{ c }})"></i>{% endfor %}</div><b>{{ w.b }}</b></div>{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if vids[1] %}{% set v = vids[1] %}{% include "video-band.njk" %}{% endif %}

<section class="block" id="bulten">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="news">
      <div>
        <h2>Cuma bülteni</h2>
        <p>Haftada bir e-posta: hafta sonu tarifi, yeni videolar ve market listesi.</p>
      </div>
      <form id="newsForm" novalidate>
        <label for="email" class="eyebrow" style="flex-basis:100%;color:#10200A">E-posta adresin</label>
        <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="ad@ornek.com" autocomplete="email">
        <button type="submit">Abone ol</button>
        <div class="msg" id="newsMsg" role="status"></div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
